&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Software Development Manager to lead a team of 8-14 engineers building critical settlement platform capabilities. You will own the technical direction, delivery, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed GrammarErrorHighlight SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot;&gt;people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;growth for your team while partnering closely with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot;&gt;business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;stakeholders to deliver a world-class&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot;&gt;finance &amp;amp;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot;&gt;settlement platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW131912817 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot;&gt;The CGFS (Coupang Global Financial Settlement) team&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot;&gt;is responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;the end-to-end settlement platform — from vendor master management and AR/AP register&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot;&gt;, through netting engines and tax invoicing, to payment execution and GL posting. We process billions of dollars in settlements annually across multiple countries and business models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW238621384 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Build a greenfield settlement platform processing billions in daily volume&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;High-impact role — your team&#39;s work directly affects vendor/seller payment accuracy and speed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;distributed systems at massive scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Lead, hire, and grow a team of 8-14 backend engineers building core settlement platform services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Own technical delivery of key platform capabilities including &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;revenue/inventory accounting,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;AR/AP processing, tax invoicing, integration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;with fintech &amp;amp; SAP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Accounting, Treasury, and Tax teams to translate complex business requirements into scalable technical solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Drive architecture decisions across Java backend services, distributed data stores (MySQL/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;TiDB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, DynamoDB, Aurora), and streaming infrastructure (Kafka, Flink, Spark)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Establish engineering excellence — code quality, operational readiness, on-call practices, and incident response&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Manage cross-functional dependencies and delivery timelines across multiple platform capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers, conduct performance reviews, and build a high-performing engineering culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Drive migration from legacy SAP-based settlement to modern microservices architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
