&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with relational databases (MySQL, Aurora, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;TiDB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;) and NoSQL (DynamoDB)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Experience with event-driven architectures and streaming platforms (Kafka, Flink, or Spark)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Track record&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of delivering large-scale, high-reliability platforms on time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Strong communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;skills — ability to translate between business stakeholders and engineering teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;BS/MS in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
