&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g1wsxa&quot; data-start=&quot;3918&quot; data-end=&quot;4040&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3920&quot; data-end=&quot;4040&quot;&gt;Support deployment validation and readiness assessments through checklists, criteria, and quality assurance processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1id0nuj&quot; data-start=&quot;4041&quot; data-end=&quot;4171&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4043&quot; data-end=&quot;4171&quot;&gt;Identify recurring issues and translate findings into improvements across training, enablement guidance, and curriculum updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4173&quot; data-end=&quot;4191&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4173&quot; data-end=&quot;4191&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4193&quot; data-end=&quot;4205&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4193&quot; data-end=&quot;4205&quot;&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4206&quot; data-end=&quot;4817&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q219pt&quot; data-start=&quot;4206&quot; data-end=&quot;4318&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4208&quot; data-end=&quot;4318&quot;&gt;Proven experience delivering instructor-led training to professional audiences of more than 50 participants.&lt;/p&gt;
