&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Short commute times – we try to match you to opportunities near your home&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positive work environment and the tools you need to do your job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eligible for any of BAYADA’s group medical, prescription drug, dental, and vision benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;if you work an average of 30 hours per week&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
