&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;to join our team in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Central Pennsylvania Senior Living&lt;/strong&gt; office. This office services our&lt;strong&gt; geriatric clients&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;on a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;per visit basis&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Senior Living Communities&lt;/strong&gt; throughout&lt;strong&gt; Chester County&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
